### Variáveis Globais
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@authToken = cole_seu_token_aqui

### -------------------------------------------
### 1. HEALTH CHECK
### -------------------------------------------

### Verificar se o backend está online
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### -------------------------------------------
### 2. AUTENTICAÇÃO (/api/auth/*)
### -------------------------------------------

### Login com a Conta Demo (já vem com 20 pets populados)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tutor@cesar.school",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Signup (Criar Nova Conta de Tutor)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Tutora",
  "email": "maria@cesar.school",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Consultar Usuário Autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### -------------------------------------------
### 3. CRUD DE PETS (/pets ou /api/pets)
### -------------------------------------------

### Listar todos os pets do tutor logado
GET {{baseUrl}}/pets
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Cadastrar um novo pet
POST {{baseUrl}}/pets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "nome": "Paçoca",
  "especie": "cachorro",
  "porte": "medio",
  "idadeMeses": 14
}

### Alternar status do passeio do pet (pendente <-> concluido)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/pets/p1/toggle
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{}

### Registrar passeio com GPS e Foto
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/pets/p1/passeio
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "statusPasseio": "concluido",
  "local": {
    "latitude": -8.059,
    "longitude": -34.872,
    "precisaoMetros": 8
  },
  "fotoUri": "file:///caminho/local/foto.jpg"
}

### Atualizar dados cadastrais do pet
PUT {{baseUrl}}/pets/p1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "nome": "Rex Atualizado",
  "especie": "cachorro",
  "porte": "grande",
  "idadeMeses": 25,
  "statusPasseio": "concluido"
}

### Popular os 20 pets de exemplo na conta atual (opcional)
POST {{baseUrl}}/pets/seed
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Excluir um pet
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/pets/p1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
